## Pre-Commit Security Checklist

**Before committing ANY code that queries the database:**

- [ ] Run `./scripts/audit-foundry-isolation.sh` - must show 0 violations
- [ ] All `.from('tasks')` queries have `.eq('foundry_id', foundry_id)`
- [ ] All `.from('objectives')` queries have `.eq('foundry_id', foundry_id)`
- [ ] All `.from('teams')` queries have `.eq('foundry_id', foundry_id)`
- [ ] All `.from('profiles')` queries EITHER:
  - Have `.eq('foundry_id', foundry_id)`, OR
  - Have `.eq('id', user.id)` (self-query), OR
  - Have `// SECURITY:` comment explaining why filtering is not needed
- [ ] Server actions verify `resource.foundry_id === user_foundry_id` before mutations
- [ ] No queries fetch data without user context

